  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.101 - AM041 limits branch exclusivity to single-execution configuration callbacks\n- Opposite if/else registrations are suppressed only inside a direct MapperConfiguration callback\n- Repeatable helpers and Profile paths now report when separate executions can select both branches and register a duplicate map\n- Loop-nested branches remain diagnostic because different iterations can select both arms\n- Source-defined MapperConfiguration namespace lookalikes fail closed unless their assembly matches the recognized CreateMap calls\n- Switch and if/else mutual-exclusion proofs now share one boundary\n- No rule ID or severity changes",
